taxonomy audit of audit/fixture 1.0.0
  lock sha256:the-fixture
  at 2026-01-01, over 5 documents and 6 declared edge halves
  5 of them are classified, and 0 generated by this engine and carrying a declared
  identity. Both are nodes, so both are here, and a check report counts the first
  number alone.
  It measures the schema against the corpus, and every finding here is about
  the taxonomy. It gates nothing.
  One bar is declared: `last_verified` is stale after 90 days. It is the only
  number a declaration states, so it is the only reading below that carries a
  finding. Everything else is a distribution, and nothing declares how narrow a
  distribution may get before it is a defect.

