  `supersedes` has 1 of 2 halves on a document past the declared window

relations, by the creator each one declares
  Q4 keeps `created_by` on the relation type, so every row is a relation and never
  an edge instance. Two halves of one relation carry one value whatever wrote them.
  `captured` is the share of eligible documents that declared at least one half.
