shelves that hold several kinds
  The discriminator is self-asserted, and kind decides every obligation after it.
  A shelf that drifts toward its cheapest kind is what this reading shows.
  library — discriminator `doc_type`, 2 documents
        0 catalog
        1 manual
        1 note

dwell in the current state
  Observed and never policed. A state nothing sits in has a row too.
  draft             1 document, 47 to 47 days, median 47
  current          3 documents, 12 to 245 days, median 31
  superseded        1 document, 122 to 122 days, median 122
  deprecated       0 documents, and no dwell reading

what this verb does not measure, and what each one waits on
  transition continuity — a record of a transition. A document states the state it is in and the date it entered, and nothing states the state it left, so no run can tell one entry into `current` from a second one
  scent quality — authored cues. Q20 puts a cue on a relation instance, and OBL-repo-0023 records that no corpus has authored enough of them to grade
  promotion rate — a population and an input. No document of this corpus carries `warrant: asserted`, and promotions per change reads a history of changes that no crate of this engine opens
